ns195:CPEV	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.4 - 23 April 2019 - Added class Event subclass of l0:EventOrSituation; PublicEvent defined as subclass of Event. In PublicEvent the restriction on holdsRoleInTime has been corrected with hasRiT to reflect the changes in Role ontology. Deleted an error axiom. Audience has become subclass of l0:Collection" .
ns200:livestockfarm-description	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.2 - introduction of some annotation properties" .
ns195:Project	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.3 - 01  November 2020 - introduction of the following elements for the project: call, programme, work package, summary and their related restrictions." .
ns200:analysis	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.0 - 2023 - Revision of the subclasses of the SemenAnalysis with the introduction of the SpermAnalysis class useful to distinguish a generic sperm analysis to the DNA fragmanetation and Official Semen Control Analysis" .
ns195:IoT	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.1 - June 9 2020 - modification of the alignments to l0 for Method, FeatureOfInterest, ObservationParameter classes" .
ns199:rendis	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.3 - updated in March 2024 - Ontology metadata inserted - June 2025 - Authors inserted" .
ns200:livestock-assessment	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.1 - 2023 - First version of the ontology - ontology creation" .
ns194:dcatapit	owl:versionInfo	"Version 2.0 - updated on 23th June 2022 - Introduced ADMS-AP_IT metadata for schema.gov.it harvisting purposes and fixing some typo" .
ns195:NDC	owl:versionInfo	"0.1 - 19 November 2021 - Creation of the profile" .
ns111:	owl:versionInfo	"1.0 - Modified on 29 October 2024" .
