ns120:	owl:versionInfo	"1.2 - Modified on 30 May 2025" .
ns195:Transparency	owl:versionInfo	"version 0.2 - added property appliesToOrganization which replaces appliesToPA, added property exceprionObligationNote, updated TransparencyObligation and TransparencySubjct modifing restrictions and stating skos:Concept derivation, stating disjoint among TransparencyArchiveActivity and TransparencyUpdateActivity." .
ns195:Indicator	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.1 - 2020 - Creation of the first version of the ontology" .
ns195:CPV	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.8 - updated on 15th of March 2023 - Deleted Registered Family and everything related to civil registration information of persons (e.g., parental relationship as store in the national civil registry, family sheet holder). Deleted BornDead class and introduced the Gender concept to be distinguished from the Sex Concept. Simplified the residence modelling leaving in the ontology only two main elaments: a general residentIn property for a Person and the ResidenceInTime reification to model this type of general information on the residence of a person that may change over time. Changed the domain of the property hasLevelOfEducation to be used for every type of person and changed the metadata of the ontology." .
ns200:lactation-assessment	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.1 - 2023 - Creation of the ontology" .
ns200:milk-functional-testing	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.1 - 2023 - Creation of the ontology" .
ns200:milking-efficiency-assessment	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.1 - 2023 - Creation of the ontology" .
ns200:livestockfarm-building-description	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.2 - introduction of OWL restrictions." .
ns131:	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.0 - Modified 10 February 2025" .
ns118:	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.0 - Modified on 06 June 2024" .
ns125:	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.0 - Modified on 06 June 2024" .
ns116:	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.0 - Modified on 17 January 2024" .
ns124:	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.0 - Modified on 17 January 2024" .
ns130:	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.0 - Modified on 3 November 2023" .
ns117:	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.1 - Modified on 17 January 2024" .
ns129:	owl:versionInfo	"Version 2.1 - Modified on 01 December 2023" .
ns127:	owl:versionInfo	"Version 2.2 - Modified on 24 June 2025" .
ns128:	owl:versionInfo	"Version 3.2 - Modified June 24th 2025" .
ns195:COV	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.12 - Modified 30 September 2020 - Fixed some typos and introduced the object property hasAlternativeIdentifier that can be associated with the Organization. Currently the property exploits the Identifier class (with its properties) defined in the context of the Core Location Vocabulary (CLV) - Italian Application Profile, which is imported in this ontology. However, a better modelling would suggest to create an ontological module for Identifiers that is exteranal to the CLV and that can be then re-used by this ontology, the CLV ontology and potentially other ontologies of the OntoPiA network." .
ns195:AccessCondition	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.1 - 18 June 2018 - Creation of the first version of the ontology" .
ns195:ACCO	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.4 - 31 July 2018 - Fix URI for controlled vocabulary. Stablized some properties. Added the user rating to the accommodation" .
ns195:TI	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.8 - Modified on 06 November 2020 - Revision of the range of some object properties in linea with their inverse properties." .
ns200:ale	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.0- June 2023 - Introduction of new animal life events, i.e., weaning, weighing, breast feeding termination, back fat thickness measurement, and related parameters." .
ns200:leo	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.5 - 2023 - Added new ontologies (e.g., apiary, milking-efficiency-assessment, etc.)" .
ns195:l0	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.8 - 16 April 2020 - added property positionInSequence; 06 April 2020 - fixed typos for rdfs:comments of two object properties" .
ns198:cis	owl:versionInfo	"Version 3.2 -  27 May 2019 - Introduction of the inverse property \"is involved in cultural event\" used to directly connect a cultural entity with the cultural events where it is involved in. Versione 3.2 includes all those changes necessary to refactor the original ontology in order to be fully integrated in the OntoPiA network." .
ns200:weather	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.3 - June 2023 - Introduction of the installation concept for weather stations located within buildings of the livestock farm company site" .
ns195:PARK	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.2 - 13 March 2018 - Migration to the namespace w3id.org/italia." .
ns195:Learning	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.2 -  Introduction of some concepts such as Profession, QualificationLevel, credit. Better specification of the relations between learning and how this brings to the qualification." .
ns199:place	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.4 - updated in March 2024 - Ontology metadata inserted - June 2025 - Authors inserted" .
ns199:top	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.4 - updated in March 2024 - Ontology metadata inserted - June 2025 - Authors inserted" .
ns200:health-assessment	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.2 - 2023 - Revision of the ontology based on the availability of livestock assessment general ontology" .
ns195:Route	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.2- Modified on 16 April 2020 - renamed property ordering in stageOrdering and defined as subproperty of l0:positionInSequence - Modified on 24 April 2019 - Some errors have been corrected." .
ns195:RO	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.3 - Modified on April 23 2019 - Refactoring l0:Event in l0:EventOrSituation." .
ns200:animal	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.2- June 2023 - Introduced the class Hybrid Genetic Type (used in the context of swines and rabbits)" .
ns195:POT	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.3 - Modified on 24 April 2018 - Refactoring of l0:Event in l0:EventOrSituation; Use of w3id.org/italia/onto/POT/ as base URI" .
ns195:MU	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.4 - Modified on June 15 2020 - introduced MeasureType concept which is connected to Value and expressed in some MeasurementUnit." .
ns195:Language	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.1 - June 27 2018 - creation of the ontology" .
ns195:PublicContract	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.4- Modified on 23 April 2019 - Refactoring l0:Event in l0:EventOrSituation. Updated some metadata" .
ns195:CPSV	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.1 - Modified on 30 September 2020 - Use of the definition of Public Service defined in the European application profile CPSV-AP. This emerged from users requests expressed in the following issue: https://github.com/italia/dati-semantic-assets/issues/92" .
ns195:CLV	owl:versionInfo	"Version 1.0 - Modified on 29 April 2019 - Deleted Named Individuals for Geographical Distribution and added in contrast the reference to the new controlled vocabulary. Refactoring of L0:Event in l0:EventOrSituation. Change in the modelling of Tiponym Qualifier and change in the labelling of the classes and properties." .
ns200:livestock-indicator	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.4 - 2022 - Introduction of the concept of collection of livestock indicator collection, with related properties. Renamed some properties." .
ns200:apiary	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.1- October 2023 - Initial draft of the ontology" .
ns199:inspire-mf	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.5 - updated in March 2024 - Ontology metadata inserted - June 2025 - Authors inserted" .
ns195:SM	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.7 - change of super class of TelephoneType and EmailType; New title of the ontology; Introduction of Contact Point generic class specialized in Physical and Online Contact Point. Introduction of the object property available that connects a contact point with access conditions. Changed the restrictions in UserAccount " .
ns200:co	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.3 - 2022 - General update of the ontology based on new data" .
ns195:POI	owl:versionInfo	"Version 0.3 - Modified on 23 April 2019 - Refactoring l0:Event in l0:EventOrSituation." .
